{"title":"The Summer Queen","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Summer Queen is a named <a href=\"#/monster/summer-queen\">Summer Queen</a> seen at level 52.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Summer Queen</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2251, 1478</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-summer-queen\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3d45df5330ab70a2d5c7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fae-mote\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e330886da6237ae5ac02.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fae Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/6455a2fc64d11c946ff5.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Summer Queen</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/summer-queen\">Summer Queen</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>52</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>990</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}